              "discards only"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Class form is reusable, reentrant if written for it",
            "And subclassable — best for library-facing APIs",
            "ExitStack is the only all-or-nothing option (pop_all)"
          ]
        }
