        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Async Rules Worth Keeping",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "`async with` outside `async def` is a SyntaxError",
            "__aexit__ can await — sync __exit__ cannot",
            "CancelledError reaches __aexit__ like any exception",
            "Shield or `finally` if teardown must complete",
            "`async with` takes the comma form too"
          ]
        },
