        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Worked Example: Transaction"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "python",
          "lines": [
            "@contextmanager",
            "def txn(conn):",
            "    conn.execute('BEGIN')",
            "    try:",
            "        yield conn",
            "    except Exception:",
            "        conn.rollback(); raise",
            "    else:",
            "        conn.commit()"
          ],
          "runnable": false
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "style": "tip",
          "title": "One-Yield Rule",
          "text": "Zero yields raises `generator didn't yield`. Two raise `generator didn't stop`. Teardown after a bare yield is skipped on error — always wrap it in try/finally."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Design Guidance",
          "ink": "blue"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
